# GET /api: the contracts, one page per route, and the one form they share
route     GET /api
handler   contracts
memo      the contract of GET /api on tiesapi.com
input
  nothing
processing
  1 read every file under catalog/contracts/
  2 for each: its route, its title, and the head of its chain (the hash a session cites)
  3 give the form, once, and the handlers a contract may name
output
  200 {url, form, handlers, contracts: [{name, url, route, title, head, current}]}; a file that breaks the form has error
  check: every route of GET / has exactly one contract here
graph
  the form is defined once, here, for every page
example
  GET /api
